:: A3 Gumboh Talk 1 [dialogue act3 char-Gumboh] {"position":"570,1850","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "The smell of boiled seaweed drifts across the kitchen, past a labyrinth of empty shelves. A large, hulking Merperson stands with their back to you, hunched over a gently bubbling cauldron.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Eelis? That you again?" "suspicious">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "Um, yep. That's me... Eelis." "A3 Gumboh Talk 2a" -5>>
<<reply "It's not Eelis, no..." "A3 Gumboh Talk 2b" 5>>
<</choices>>


:: A3 Gumboh Talk 2a [dialogue act3 char-Gumboh] {"position":"700,1790","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "The giant cook turns around. as their eyes fall upon you, their brow furrows.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Oh. A trick." "hurt">>
<<stage "They set down their ladle in the giant cauldron and fold their arms across their chest.">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "I'm sorry. I don't know what I was playing at. It's been... a long day" "A3 Gumboh Talk 3a" 5>>
<<reply "Cheer up! Can't you take a joke?" "A3 Gumboh Talk 3b" -5>>
<</choices>>


:: A3 Gumboh Talk 2b [dialogue act3 char-Gumboh] {"position":"700,1910","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "The giant cook turns around. As their eyes fall upon you, they break out into a warm smile.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Ah. You!" "intrigued">>
<<stage "They set down their ladle in the giant cauldron, rest their hands on their waiste and peer at you with a curious smile.">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "You know who I am?" "A3 Gumboh Talk 4" >>
<<reply "Always have been, always will be!" "A3 Gumboh Talk 4">>
<</choices>>


:: A3 Gumboh Talk 3a [dialogue act3 char-Gumboh] {"position":"830,1790","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "The cook let's out a deep, tired laugh.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "That's ok. Everybody is tired. Everybody is hungry. But you are lucky..." "weary">>
<<stage "In one graceful movement they turn back to the cauldron, one hand slipping a bowl from the counter as the other ladles in a generous portion of piping hot soup, without a drop being spilled.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "In Gumboh's kitchen, the most tired, the most hungry, eats first." "proudly">>
<<stage "Gumboh holds the bowl towards you. Their eyes encourage you to take it.">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "Thank you, Gumboh. It's a pleasure to meet you." "A3 Gumboh Talk 6a" 5>>
<</choices>>


:: A3 Gumboh Talk 3b [dialogue act3 char-Gumboh] {"position":"830,1790","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "The cook let's out a deep, tired sigh.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Not a good time for jokes, friend. Everybody is tired. Everybody is hungry. Even you, I can tell." "morose">>
<<stage "In one graceful movement they turn back to the cauldron, one hand slipping a bowl from the counter as the other ladles in a generous portion of piping hot soup, without a drop being spilled.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "In Gumboh's kitchen, the most tired, the most hungry, eats first. Even the rude ones." "weary">>
<<stage "Gumboh holds the bowl towards you, lowering their eyes to the floor.">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "Thank you, Gumboh. I'm sorry about being rude. you're right, I'm just exhausted." "A3 Gumboh Talk 5" 5>>
<<reply "No offense, but that doesn't look very appetising." "A3 Gumboh Talk 6b" -5>>
<</choices>>


:: A3 Gumboh Talk 4 [dialogue act3 char-Gumboh] {"position":"700,1910","size":"100,100"}
<<stage "The cook opens their arms out wide.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Of course! The flavour of your reputation is cooked into the stories of the townsfolk these days. We keep very close, here in the Slums. Well..." "enthusiastic">>
<<stage "Their arms fall to their side.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Maybe not so close anymore. Everybody is tired. Everybody is hungry. Even you, I can tell." "weary">>
<<stage "In one graceful movement they turn back to the cauldron, one hand slipping a bowl from the counter as the other ladles in a generous portion of piping hot soup, without a drop being spilled.">>
<<say "Gumboh" "Lucky for you... In Gumboh's kitchen the most tired, the most hungry, eats first.">>
<<stage "Gumboh holds the bowl towards you. Their eyes encourage you to take it. Their warm smile insists.">>
<<choices>>
<<reply "Thank you, Gumboh. It's a pleasure to meet you." "A3 Gumboh Talk 6a" 5>>
<</choices>>


